{"id":"elu_devarim","sections":[{"title":{"he":"אלו דברים","en":"These Are the Things"},"segments":[{"key":"Sf4oiNx5Ax","he":[[{"t":"אֵלּוּ דְבָרִים שֶׁאֵין לָהֶם שִׁעוּר. הַפֵּאָה, וְהַבִּכּוּרִים, וְהָרֵאָיוֹן, וּגְמִילוּת חֲסָדִים, וְתַלְמוּד תּוֹרָה. אֵלּוּ דְבָרִים שֶׁאָדָם אוֹכֵל פֵּרוֹתֵיהֶן בָּעוֹלָם הַזֶּה וְהַקֶּרֶן קַיֶּמֶת לוֹ לָעוֹלָם הַבָּא. כִּבּוּד אָב וָאֵם, וּגְמִילוּת חֲסָדִים, וַהֲבָאַת שָׁלוֹם בֵּין אָדָם לַחֲבֵרוֹ, וְתַלְמוּד תּוֹרָה כְּנֶגֶד כֻּלָּם:"}]],"en":"These are the things that have no definite quantity: The corners [of the field]. First-fruits; [The offerings brought] on appearing [at the Temple on the three pilgrimage festivals]. The performance of righteous deeds; And the study of the torah. The following are the things for which a man enjoys the fruits in this world while the principal remains for him in the world to come: Honoring one’s father and mother; The performance of righteous deeds; And the making of peace between a person and his friend; And the study of the torah is equal to them all."}]},{"title":{"he":"כיבוד אב ואם","en":"Honoring Parents"},"segments":[{"key":"4N5kDdywqr","he":[[{"t":"כַּבֵּד אֶת־אָבִיךָ וְאֶת־אִמֶּךָ לְמַעַן יַאֲרִכוּן יָמֶיךָ עַל הָאֲדָמָה אֲשֶׁר־יְהֹוָה אֱלֹהֶיךָ נֹתֵן לָךְ׃"}]],"en":"Honour thy father and thy mother, that thy days may be long upon the land which the LORD thy God giveth thee."}]},{"title":{"he":"הכנסת אורחים","en":"Hosting Guests"},"segments":[{"key":"ezOaKHiLvz","he":[[{"t":"וַיֵּרָא אֵלָיו יְהֹוָה בְּאֵלֹנֵי מַמְרֵא וְהוּא יֹשֵׁב פֶּתַח־הָאֹהֶל כְּחֹם הַיּוֹם׃"}]],"en":"And the LORD appeared unto him by the terebinths of Mamre, as he sat in the tent door in the heat of the day;"},{"key":"XZFLGGtCiv","he":[[{"t":"וַיִּשָּׂא עֵינָיו וַיַּרְא וְהִנֵּה שְׁלֹשָׁה אֲנָשִׁים נִצָּבִים עָלָיו וַיַּרְא וַיָּרָץ לִקְרָאתָם מִפֶּתַח הָאֹהֶל וַיִּשְׁתַּחוּ אָרְצָה׃"}]],"en":"and he lifted up his eyes and looked, and, lo, three men stood over against him; and when he saw them, he ran to meet them from the tent door, and bowed down to the earth,"},{"key":"xtE2Czwgy0","he":[[{"t":"וַיֹּאמַר אֲדֹנָי אִם־נָא מָצָאתִי חֵן בְּעֵינֶיךָ אַל־נָא תַעֲבֹר מֵעַל עַבְדֶּךָ׃"}]],"en":"and said: ‘My lord, if now I have found favour in thy sight, pass not away, I pray thee, from thy servant."},{"key":"pglhh_tUvD","he":[[{"t":"יֻקַּח־נָא מְעַט־מַיִם וְרַחֲצוּ רַגְלֵיכֶם וְהִשָּׁעֲנוּ תַּחַת הָעֵץ׃"}]],"en":"Let now a little water be fetched, and wash your feet, and recline yourselves under the tree."},{"key":"FHgzDzMvG4","he":[[{"t":"וְאֶקְחָה פַת־לֶחֶם וְסַעֲדוּ לִבְּכֶם אַחַר תַּעֲבֹרוּ כִּי־עַל־כֵּן עֲבַרְתֶּם עַל־עַבְדְּכֶם וַיֹּאמְרוּ כֵּן תַּעֲשֶׂה כַּאֲשֶׁר דִּבַּרְתָּ׃"}]],"en":"And I will fetch a morsel of bread, and stay ye your heart; after that ye shall pass on; forasmuch as ye are come to your servant.’ And they said: ‘So do, as thou hast said.’"},{"key":"cx6Rp28NSI","he":[[{"t":"וַיְמַהֵר אַבְרָהָם הָאֹהֱלָה אֶל־שָׂרָה וַיֹּאמֶר מַהֲרִי שְׁלֹשׁ סְאִים קֶמַח סֹלֶת לוּשִׁי וַעֲשִׂי עֻגוֹת׃"}]],"en":"And Abraham hastened into the tent unto Sarah, and said: ‘Make ready quickly three measures of fine meal, knead it, and make cakes.’"},{"key":"XNiSvjhchN","he":[[{"t":"וְאֶל־הַבָּקָר רָץ אַבְרָהָם וַיִּקַּח בֶּן־בָּקָר רַךְ וָטוֹב וַיִּתֵּן אֶל־הַנַּעַר וַיְמַהֵר לַעֲשׂוֹת אֹתוֹ׃"}]],"en":"And Abraham ran unto the herd, and fetched a calf tender and good, and gave it unto the servant; and he hastened to dress it."},{"key":"rY2vXUdxAN","he":[[{"t":"וַיִּקַּח חֶמְאָה וְחָלָב וּבֶן־הַבָּקָר אֲשֶׁר עָשָׂה וַיִּתֵּן לִפְנֵיהֶם וְהוּא־עֹמֵד עֲלֵיהֶם תַּחַת הָעֵץ וַיֹּאכֵלוּ׃"}]],"en":"And he took curd, and milk, and the calf which he had dressed, and set it before them; and he stood by them under the tree, and they did eat."}]}],"credits":[{"title":"Mishnah Peah — Torat Emet 357","license":"Public Domain","url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Mishnah_Peah"},{"title":"Mishnah Peah — Mishnah Yomit by Dr. Joshua Kulp","license":"CC-BY","url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Mishnah_Peah"},{"title":"Exodus — Tanach with Nikkud","license":"Public Domain","url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Exodus"},{"title":"Exodus — The Holy Scriptures (JPS 1917)","license":"Public Domain","url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Exodus"},{"title":"Genesis — Tanach with Nikkud","license":"Public Domain","url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Genesis"},{"title":"Genesis — The Holy Scriptures (JPS 1917)","license":"Public Domain","url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Genesis"}]}